# Privacy policy of {{ a.instanceName ?? missing }}

{% if revision is not null %}
Policy text version {{ textVersion }}, FetchDock {{ appVersion }}, revision {{ revision }}.
{% else %}
Preview of policy text version {{ textVersion }}, FetchDock {{ appVersion }}. This text is not published.
